  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional strengthening of SCCCO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to assist the Swaziland Coalition of Concerned Civic Organisations (SCCCO/Coalition) in strengthening its activities and skill building in the promotion of human rights, democracy and good governance in Swaziland.  

From an organisational assessment that was recently conducted by CAFOD, it was noted that there are a number of internal developments which require attention for the strengthening and sustainability of the organisation. SCCCO&#x2019;s strategic documents have all come to an end and the organisation does not currently have an operational strategic plan. In addition, some anomalies, duplication and gaps have been identified in the operation of SCCCO governance documents, structures and policy. It will thus be important to have a strategic document that guides the organisation&#x2019;s work moving forward. 

CAFOD&#x2019;s grant will support:

&#x2022;	Strategic planning
&#x2022;	Legal review and harmonisation of SCCCO Governance documents, i.e. Trust Deed and Constitution
&#x2022;	Advanced Excel and Pastel Training for Finance staff
&#x2022;	Training on finance for non-finance staff
&#x2022;	Training on research and information management.</narrative>
  </description>
